"label": "Conclusion",
"text": "Analysis of ctDNA and PET/CT in large B-cell lymphoma are complementary data for evaluating tumor burden and tumor clearance after treatment. Analysis of radiomic data might help to identify tumor characteristics and their changes after treatment."
